{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Ishmael fled with eight men to Ammon
Back to the king who had set the plan
The remnant moved toward the land of E[Bmaj7]gypt
Af[G#m]raid of the Chaldeans and the debt they might [D#m]pay
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
They did not obey the voice of [Bmaj7]the Lord
[G#m]And went to Tahpanhes with the [D#m]sword
They did not obey the voice of [Bmaj7]the Lord [G#m]
{end_of_verse}
